      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WONDER I DO (1) settled back off the inside but went through his gears strongly to find the frame with a 0.8 lengths second (29.98) at this track in Grade 4/5. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Can go on with it. REGAL KADE (3) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (30.10) at this track behind Hey Arnold in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Will give a great sight again. LOCO BOOM (2) was below best last time when fifth at this track but prior to that among the placings in quick time (29.80) at this track. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Rates a winning chance on best. TARAWI BRUMBY (6) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
